:: MP Collection Resolve CrownGear Step3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "High Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "High Street">>
<</if>>
机括城的主泵房里，三枚齿轮终于套进王冠状的传动架。配重缓缓抬起，暗河的水位在刻度管里一格一格退下去。可主发条还在回弹，你必须在它咬死之前把锁销插进轴心。
<<set _ok to 0>>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 320 or ($science or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _ok to 1>>
	你顶住回弹的铜柄，把锁销一寸寸推到位。泵轴重新转动时，整座石廊都跟着轻轻一震。
	<<stress -4>>
<<else>>
	锁销在最后一寸滑脱，回弹的铜柄扫过你的肋骨。水位退到一半又停住，你只能先松开手。
	<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
<</if>>
<<set _reward to 800>>
<<if _ok is 1>><<set _reward to 2500>>
<<elseif $mpClues["collect_crown_gear_ratio"] or $mpClues["collect_crown_gear_path"]>><<set _reward to 1600>>
<</if>>
<<set $mpDoneCrownGear to 1>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_crown_gear_complete")>>
	<<set $mpCollectHubUnlocked to ($mpCollectHubUnlocked or 0) + 1>>
	<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>
	<<willpower 4>><<control 12>><<trauma -4>>
<</if>>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("collect_crown_gear_payout")>>
	你把泵房里拆下的一枚旧王冠齿徽收进衣袋，又从工具柜底层翻出约 £<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>> 的维修备用金。
	<<money _reward>><<stress -6>>
<<else>>
	泵房已经恢复运转，工具柜里没有第二笔备用金。
	<<stress -2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[把备用齿徽交给塞拉保管 (0:04)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sera")>><<npcincr Sera trust 1>><</if>><<set $mpClues["collect_crown_gear_sera"] to 1>><<stress -4>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[把王冠齿轮嵌回泵房原位 (0:05)|MP Collection Quests Hub]]>><<set $mpClues["collect_crown_gear_sealed"] to 1>><<control 8>><<stress -2>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[把齿徽收进内袋离开 (0:03)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Temple")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Temple">>
<</if>>
圣堂地下修道院的抄经室里，三张羊皮残页的切口能对上，字序却是断的。乔丹说这不是祷词，是老教团封存地窖的清单：哪只箱子装过谁的姓名，哪块基石后面还有暗龛。念错顺序，墙里的铜钟会先响。
<<if ($history or 0) gte 320 or ($english or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_abyss_page_order"] to 1>>
	你按羊皮背后的针孔把三页排成回环，启句与应答终于接上。乔丹在旁轻轻呼出一口气。
	<<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你把应答页放反了。灯焰一歪，蜡油滴在边角，焦味立刻漫开。乔丹伸手把灯移远。
	<<stress 4>><<pain 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[请乔丹指认页脚的旧修院编号 (0:05)|MP Collection Resolve AbyssPage Step2]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Jordan")>><<npcincr Jordan trust 1>><</if>><<pass 5>><</link>>
