:: MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
断桅沉船滩的雾还没散。三块火漆印戒残片不是一枚戒指断成三截，而是三块印面：船首、浪脊、王冠。合在一起才是旧港走私王完整的花押，也正好是防水箱蜡锁的凹槽形状。箱子里可能有账，也可能只有海水——但那是唯一能证明走私链的东西。
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_smuggler_ring_hull"] to 1>>
	你把手伸进船肋的锈缝，摸到固定蜡锁的铜片。潮水漫过脚踝时，你已经把箱角撬松了半寸。
	<<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	锈蚀的船肋夹住你的指节。你抽手时带下一片铁鳞，血珠立刻被海水冲淡。
	<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[带着印面去码头干船坞 (0:08)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step2]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[先量一遍蜡锁凹槽 (0:06)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step2]]>><<set $mpClues["collect_smuggler_ring_shape"] to 1>><<stress -1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[趁涨潮前退回岸上 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks">>
<<effects>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Docks")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Docks">>
<</if>>
干船坞的闸门只开了一条缝。格威岚蹲在龙骨阴影里补网，见你摊开三块印面，便把手里那截旧缆绳递过来。
「蜡锁不怕火，怕潮，」格威岚说，「旧港的箱子只在退潮后半个时辰能开。你得先算准下一次。」
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 300 or ($english or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpClues["collect_smuggler_ring_tide"] to 1>>
	你把潮表与舱单上的吃水线对上，算出明早退潮的空档。格威岚用刀尖在木板上划了个记号。
	<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan trust 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<<else>>
	你把潮汐时辰记错了半刻。格威岚没说什么，只把缆绳收回去，指了指坞门外已经漫上来的水线。
	<<tiredness 2>><<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[趁退潮回沉船滩开箱 (0:09)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step3]]>><<pass 9>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[请格威岚一起守到退潮 (0:07)|MP Collection Resolve SmugglerRing Step3]]>><<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Gwylan")>><<npcincr Gwylan love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>><<pass 7>><</link>>
